GeneralsX: main thread wait counters for the game's frame hitch report.
The exported GeneralsX_GetSyncStats returns running totals of the time
the main thread waited in buffer and texture locks (for the GPU or the CS
thread) and in other CS thread synchronizations, with a description of
the slowest wait since the previous call.

